    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You were found on the floor by your son after a fall. You had gone to the commode. You do not remember the whole event. You were on the floor for about 5 minutes.\n\nThe team found:\n- A fall where you did not remember the whole event\n- Possible sepsis and possible aspiration pneumonia\n- Inflammation of part of your bowel (sigmoid diverticulitis)\n- Dilated bowel loops that may point to a blockage, and a build-up of stool\n- A short-term worsening of your kidney function (AKI) and raised markers of inflammation during your stay\n\nYou also have a number of existing health conditions, including a recent heart event (NSTEMI), high blood pressure (hypertension), heart disease (ischaemic heart disease), long-term kidney disease (chronic kidney disease), and others."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "The team ran a number of tests, including:\n- Blood tests and blood cultures\n- A urine culture\n- Heart tracings (ECGs) — these showed a short run of an irregular heart rhythm (atrial flutter)\n- Scans of your head, neck and chest — nothing new was found on these\n- A chest X-ray on 12/05/26 — this was negative\n- An abdominal X-ray — this showed dilated bowel loops and a build-up of stool\n- A CT scan — this showed consolidation in the lower right part of your lung and inflammation of part of your bowel (sigmoid diverticulitis)\n\nThe team treated you with:\n- An antibiotic (Tazocin) given through a drip\n- Fluids through a drip\n- Oxygen\n- An amber care plan was put in place"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7"
          ],
          "text": "A referral to the memory clinic has been advised for you as an outpatient. This is because the team thinks you may have an underlying memory condition (possible dementia)."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.4",
          "heading": "safety_net",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{SAFETY_NET}}"
        }
